e286376abb91795fa7218accc4aa48bdecf3403725d84ec54539beeaccc848ab  .codex/skills/agent-loop/scripts/run-codex-review.sh  LAUNCH: Codex reviewer leg — `codex exec --dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox --ephemeral --ignore-rules --ignore-user-config --skip-git-repo-check -C <launch root> --add-dir <review worktree>`. Sandbox off; the isolation is the pinned launch root, not the CLI
48dc24657008c9507a16e97ef215d5ecff1ae45fbae8245ac6607e5d26d2e20c  .codex/skills/agent-loop/scripts/run-codex-review.sh  LAUNCH: Claude reviewer leg of the same script — `--effort $CLAUDE_EFFORT_POLICY --permission-mode bypassPermissions --no-session-persistence --disable-slash-commands --safe-mode --add-dir <review worktree> --print`. Runs inside the subshell that has already cd'd to the pinned launch root
